%N A074321 Numbers k such that the k-th perfect power + k is prime: k + A001597(k) is prime.
%C A074321 The primes of the form k + A001597(k) are in A075781.
%H A074321 Amiram Eldar, <a href="/A074321/b074321.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%e A074321 k = 3: pp(3) + 3 = 8 + 3 = 11 is prime.
%t A074321 With[{pow = Select[Range[2*10^5], # == 1 || GCD @@ FactorInteger[#][[;; , 2]] > 1 &]}, Position[pow + Range[Length[pow]], _?PrimeQ]] // Flatten (* _Amiram Eldar_, Oct 12 2026 *)
